; -X converts through a chain of prices: AAA is quoted in BBB, and CCC
; is quoted in BBB, so converting AAA to CCC takes one hop forward and
; one hop backward.  Each hop uses its latest price on or before the
; valuation date, and a hop with no price by then cuts the chain,
; leaving the amount unconverted.

commodity CCC
    format 1.00 CCC

P 2024/01/01 AAA 2.00 BBB
P 2024/03/01 AAA 3.00 BBB
P 2024/02/15 CCC 0.25 BBB

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Cash      1 AAA
    Equity:Opening

test bal Assets -X CCC --now 2024/02/20
            8.00 CCC  Assets:Cash
end test

test bal Assets -X CCC --now 2024/06/01
           12.00 CCC  Assets:Cash
end test

test bal Assets -X CCC --now 2024/02/01
               1 AAA  Assets:Cash
end test
